      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does WRYDECO standard freight shipping include inside delivery or uncrating?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Complimentary standard worldwide shipping covers curbside or driveway threshold delivery with liftgate service. The carrier lowers the crate to the ground at your residence. Bringing the crate or unboxed furniture inside your home is the responsibility of the homeowner, so we recommend having two people available on delivery day."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How is oversized solid wood furniture packaged to prevent transit damage?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Oversized furniture pieces are encased in custom-built heavy timber crates lined with high-density corner guards, shock-absorbing foam wrap, desiccant moisture packs, and heavy vapor-barrier film. This rigid wooden enclosure shields the solid timber from external impacts during intermodal transport."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long does crafting and freight delivery take from order date?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Estimated processing and crafting takes approximately 15 to 20 business days, followed by an estimated 3 to 5 business days in transit after dispatch, for a total estimated delivery window of 18 to 25 business days. Timelines are estimates rather than guaranteed delivery dates."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What should I do if the shipping crate appears damaged upon delivery?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Inspect the exterior of the wooden crate thoroughly upon arrival. If you notice any significant cracks, punctures, or broken framing, take clear photos and note the condition on the carrier's delivery receipt before signing. If the furniture inside is damaged, contact support@wrydeco.com within 30 calendar days for an approved replacement or return with store-paid return shipping."
      }
    }
  ]
